 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y72K6jIwGCIQ7kNvwF4VmHV&_nc_oc=Adpz0KydW7NJVew9OlSxSxdehkoI35JiCwETxZIrTAja80OwsjwFxSbU2KZ257XuX6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFP4NMOqdERdeQq0_WTEEcN59KQajuK0hDReL7nYc2PBQ&oe=6A8AD701"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ijH3i5177-EQ7kNvwEpdVba&_nc_oc=AdpRYAj8jbqQ0Z0texaAGcrmIZmq97LOgpDGQa77B3tCiFAK4Ha_dQAiqDb0788ocVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEDowW6HHUIeWQDyhMBamRqnOMx7u56xkLV8y6tAueYAw&oe=6A8AE466"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UV33x1SytsQ7kNvwFjf-Xc&_nc_oc=AdrzqBLlgY5YybIzyAddeZRwFsGT9yHdbbOogeMHseal4oRwFpJBX92LHrlQGyU2q5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELMU9Hq4MLPqNoD8IdPBYMmMyBgygQuYdDaOa9yGs-Rg&oe=6A8AEE5C"}, {"fil